      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly define errorless learning as “designed to reduce or avoid mistakes during acquisition”; it only describes “errorful learning” versus “errorless learning” in terms of conflict processing (“conflicting (EF) with conflict-reduced circumstances (EL)”).",
        "The “less interfering material at later recognition” portion is only partially supported: the packet states that “recognition following errorful learning is thought to be conflicting based on the additional interfering material,” but it does not directly claim that errorless learning has less interfering material at later recognition."
